<title>UK: Capital receives 98.3 pct of My Kinda Town.</title>
<headline>Capital receives 98.3 pct of My Kinda Town.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capital Radio said on Monday that it had received valid acceptances in respect of 98.3 percent of shares in restaurant operator My Kinda Town after its bid offer closed on December 20.</p>
<p>Capital Radio is buying My Kinda Town for approximately 51 million stg.</p>
